Advanced turbine designs and aftermarket services: Improvements in materials, operating pressures, and temperature capabilities can support better performance. Meanwhile, the global installed base creates continuing demand for maintenance, repair, overhaul, and equipment upgrades.

Asia-Pacific and the Middle East also offer opportunities associated with industrial expansion and power infrastructure investment. Manufacturers that combine reliable equipment with efficient service support and solutions tailored to emerging energy requirements may be better positioned to compete.

